<title>HUNGARY: Hungary O/N rates ease to a 21.875 percent close.</title>
<headline>Hungary O/N rates ease to a 21.875 percent close.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian overnight interest rates closed 0.375-percent lower on Monday, with traders not expecting a rise in the next few days.</p>
<p>&quot;If anything, overnight rates would ease a shade in the coming days, but could also hold present levels,&quot; said Istvan Zsoter of Takarekbank.</p>
<p>Overnight rates closed at 21.875 percent compared with Friday's close of 22.25 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
